---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Net Worth Calculator by Age" description="Privacy policy for NetWorth. 100% client-side calculation guarantee with zero data collection.">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
		<header class="text-center mb-12 space-y-2">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
		</header>

		<div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 space-y-6 font-normal leading-relaxed">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">1. 100% Client-Side Calculations</h2>
				<p>Your privacy is paramount. NetWorth executes all age, income, and net worth percentile calculations locally in your Web browser. We do not store, record, or transmit your financial inputs to any server.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">2. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
				<p>We do not use tracking cookies to build personal user profiles. Local storage may be utilized solely to remember your preferred theme or currency preferences across browser visits.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">3. Analytics & Ad Networks</h2>
				<p>We use privacy-preserving analytics to understand aggregate traffic patterns. Non-intrusive advertisements served by trusted partners like Google AdSense may be displayed in accordance with standard web privacy rules.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	
    <!-- In-Depth Privacy Policy -->
    <section class="space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-8 mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Full Privacy Protection & Security Policy</h2>
      <p>
        At Get Net Worth Calculator (getnetworthcalculator.com), your financial privacy is our top priority. This Privacy Policy details the strict client-side architecture and zero-logging principles governing our application.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">1. Zero Financial Data Transmission</h3>
      <p>
        Every calculation executed on Get Net Worth Calculator (including liquid savings, stock portfolios, real estate equity, mortgages, and consumer debt) runs 100% locally within your client web browser via JavaScript. No financial values entered into calculator fields are sent to or stored on our servers.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">2. Analytics & Server Log Files</h3>
      <p>
        Like standard web services, our servers log non-identifiable technical parameters such as IP address, browser type, operating system, timestamp, and referring URLs solely for bandwidth optimization, DDoS protection, and server health diagnostics.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">3. Cookies & Local Storage</h3>
      <p>
        We utilize minimal browser LocalStorage exclusively to persist user settings (such as dark mode toggle or selected currency preferences) on your local device. We do not use intrusive cross-site tracking cookies.
      </p>
    </section>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">4. Third-Party Links & External Government Services</h3>
      <p>
        Our website contains reference links to external government and central bank research portals (such as federalreserve.gov, ons.gov.uk, and statcan.gc.ca). Get Net Worth Calculator is not responsible for the content or privacy practices of third-party domains.
      </p>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">5. Updates to This Privacy Policy</h3>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect new browser security standards or privacy regulations. Revisions will be posted immediately to this page with an updated modification date.
      </p>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">6. Compliance with International Privacy Standards</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator adheres to international web privacy frameworks including GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation) and CCPA (California Consumer Privacy Act). Users have complete autonomy over their browser storage. Clearing your browser cache or LocalStorage immediately wipes all locally saved calculator settings from your device.
      </p>

  
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white pt-2">Global Wealth Percentile Standards</h3>
      <p>
        Get Net Worth Calculator adheres to modern web standards, W3C accessibility guidelines, and fast Core Web Vitals responsiveness. Whether calculating liquid net worth, analyzing retirement readiness, or benchmarking household balance sheets against central bank surveys, our platform delivers instant, reliable financial modeling with zero data tracking.
      </p>

  </main>
</Layout>
